# The architecture chat's ledger is never committed. ADR-0002.
CHAT_STATE.md

# Briefs are working space, overwritten each round. Only the README is
# tracked. See briefs/README.md.
briefs/*
!briefs/README.md

# Local build environment and Python artefacts. The venv is recreated from
# requirements.txt, which is committed. Brief 1.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The architecture chat's pending commit message. The implementing seat
# commits with it and deletes it. CLAUDE.md, Commands.
.commitmsg

# The operator's local instructions for replacing the CV PDF. Never
# published. cv/ itself is tracked.
cv/UPDATING.md

# The Claude Design prototype export: the build's visual reference, kept
# locally only. It loads its framework from a third-party CDN, so it must
# never be served from this site. ADR-0011.
docs/design/prototype/
